      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Cloudflare Zero Trust is a security platform that replaces traditional corporate VPNs. It checks every user identity, device health, and context before granting access to internal apps or the web. It operates on Cloudflare's global network, applying least-privilege rules without slow network bottlenecks."
